{
  "$comment": [
    "Normalised snapshot of https://developers.google.com/health/data-types.",
    "This information is NOT derivable from discovery.json: the REST path is the generic",
    "dataTypes/{dataTypesId}, so per-data-type capabilities exist only in prose documentation.",
    "Maintained by hand under review. The normal build never scrapes HTML.",
    "Endpoint ids are kebab-case; filter names are snake_case. Both are preserved verbatim",
    "and must never be derived from one another by a naming rule.",
    "Capabilities are published as METADATA only. They must not become client-side hard",
    "validation; the server remains the authority."
  ],
  "source": {
    "url": "https://developers.google.com/health/data-types",
    "verifiedOn": "2026-08-09"
  },
  "pending": [
    "recordKind (interval / instantaneous / daily) is not yet verified per data type, so it is omitted rather than guessed.",
    "webhook support is left null: the Data Types page has no webhook column and the Webhooks guide enumerates only a partial list. Still unresolved; it needs a source that states it per data type."
  ],
